OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome light
OL,6,Fand patchy rain will spread east early
OL,7,Fthis evening. Then the rest of the
OL,8,Fnight will be cloudy and mainly dry
OL,9,Fwith just a few showers.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA mainly dry start rain with
OL,12,Fthe best of the brightness through the
OL,13,FLothians and Borders. Rain will spread
OL,14,Fsoutheast across most parts during the
OL,15,Fafternoon, lingering into the evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,18,Fspreading northeast on Wednesday. Dry
OL,19,Fand bright on Thursday the odd shower
OL,20,Fin the southwest. A few showers on
OL,21,FFriday, mainly in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
